    "Q3_claim": "That there exist genuine structural isomorphisms between diverse domains (physics, math, biology) and Christian theology, which are testable, falsifiable, and have predictive power.",
    "Q4_support": "Each isomorphism is supported by a 4-test protocol (Swap Test, Bidirectional Test, Confidence Assessment, Falsification Conditions), with 27 tested, 8 candidate, 1 undetermined, 0 falsified.",
